# contract=owner-environment-config-gitignore version=1 status=DRAFT owner_task=INF-001 decisions=D-25 last_changed=2026-09-28
# While the repository is PUBLIC (ADR-017 §5), real environment files must never be committed.
# Only templates (*.example.yaml), the schema and this file are tracked.
#
# When the owner has made the repository PRIVATE and set `github.visibility: PRIVATE` in every file,
# the owner may delete the two "ignore" rules below in a reviewed PR so that dev.yaml/staging.yaml/prod.yaml
# are versioned (they still contain no secrets). Never force-add (`git add -f`) a real file before that.
*.yaml
*.yml
!*.example.yaml
!.gitignore
!environment.schema.json
!examples/
